nd_node_by_id` / `calculate_tree_sum` | `node_count > 50` | reads `node_table[50..node_count]`, past the 2600-byte object | Out-of-bounds read; unreachable from `inreftree`. Row 7 covers the *reachable* half of this (`add_tree_node`, which rejects before indexing). |"]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false}}
